{"pin":"AB00068","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00068","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art the joy of the wise! That which thou didst write with thy fragrant pen hath been perused, and in praise of God the tongue hath been loosened [3.5s]... ...Thy second question was as follows: Is it necessary for every Messenger to have had knowledge of the Books and Scriptures of the Messengers Who preceded them?","first_line_orig":"ای سرور هوشمندان آنچه بقلم مشکین نگاشتی خواندیم و باستان یزدان زبان ستایش  ","language":"Per","word_count":"1250","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA59:280","source":"INBA59","locator":"280","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v059/?page=282"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA72:001","source":"INBA72","locator":"001","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v072/?page=4"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA75:109","source":"INBA75","locator":"109","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v075/?page=115"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2_2#25 p.135x","source":"ADH2_2#25 p.135x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0646","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0646","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/603801812"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DUR1.531x","source":"DUR1","locator":"531x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DUR1.559x","source":"DUR1","locator":"559x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DUR3.140x","source":"DUR3","locator":"140x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MILAN.038","source":"MILAN","locator":"038","url":"https://www.h-net.org/~bahai/areprint/ab/M-R/M/milani/038.jpg"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJMJ1.112x","source":"MJMJ1","locator":"112x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT1.452","source":"MKT1","locator":"452","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA1/ma1-451.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT2.064","source":"MKT2","locator":"064","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA2/ma2-64.html"},{"kind":"publicat